{"timestamp": 1770498493005.0532, "start_timestamp": 1770498493001, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/ai/optimize", "data": {"msg": "开心地整理温暖的音乐，感受生活 (sweet memory)的小美好。温馨的咖啡总能常常。"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0c1dn7000tuROV1P65000ff9Yv0dn70l", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer ccee864a99c842e8a88e01ca82109b6b"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1770498494987, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": "我是一名音乐整理师🎵，专注于挖掘生活中的温暖旋律与甜蜜记忆。我擅长从日常点滴中捕捉灵感，将平凡的瞬间转化为治愈人心的音乐作品🎧。无论是轻柔的钢琴曲还是温暖的民谣，都能在我的整理下焕发出独特的生命力。\n\n温馨的咖啡时光是我创作的最佳伴侣☕，常常在氤氲的香气中寻找音乐的节奏。我相信音乐是连接情感的桥梁，能让听者在旋律中找到共鸣与慰藉。通过精心编排的音乐内容，我希望能为更多人带来心灵的温暖与力量，让生活中的小美好被温柔地记录与传递🌟。", "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Sat, 07 Feb 2026 21:08:14 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "1111769-1770498493067-6235", "lubanops-ntrace-id": "1111769-1770498493067-6235", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "Connection": "keep-alive", "appservice-request-id": "4271"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
{"timestamp": 1770498506294.4253, "start_timestamp": 1770498506290, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/ai/optimize", "data": {"msg": "我是一名音乐整理师🎵，专注于挖掘生活中的温暖旋律与甜蜜记忆。我擅长从日常点滴中捕捉灵感，将平凡的瞬间转化为治愈人心的音乐作品🎧。无论是轻柔的钢琴曲还是温暖的民谣，都能在我的整理下焕发出独特的生命力。\n\n温馨的咖啡时光是我创作的最佳伴侣☕，常常在氤氲的香气中寻找音乐的节奏。我相信音乐是连接情感的桥梁，能让听者在旋律中找到共鸣与慰藉。通过精心编排的音乐内容，我希望能为更多人带来心灵的温暖与力量，让生活中的小美好被温柔地记录与传递🌟。"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0c1dn7000tuROV1P65000ff9Yv0dn70l", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer ccee864a99c842e8a88e01ca82109b6b"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1770498508774, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": "我是一名音乐整理师🎵，专注于挖掘生活中的温暖旋律与甜蜜记忆。无论是清晨的鸟鸣、雨天的屋檐声，还是街角咖啡馆的慵懒氛围☕️，我都能从中捕捉灵感，将平凡瞬间转化为治愈人心的音乐作品🎧。\n\n擅长从日常点滴中提炼情感内核，运用编曲技巧赋予每段旋律独特生命力。无论是轻柔的钢琴曲🎹、温暖的民谣吉他🎸，还是复古的爵士乐🎷，都能在我的整理下焕发生机，让音乐成为情感的治愈载体。\n\n相信音乐是连接心灵的桥梁，常以咖啡香气为伴🌙，于氤氲中寻找音乐节奏。通过精心编排的音乐内容，希望为更多人传递心灵温暖，让生活中的小美好被温柔记录，成为岁月里可触摸的慰藉🌟。", "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Sat, 07 Feb 2026 21:08:28 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "v-1111769-1770498506294-1502", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "Connection": "keep-alive", "appservice-request-id": "4275"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
